{"id":"n1-076","title":"Noun のいかんでは","romaji":"Noun no ikan de wa","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"It depends on the Noun","longExplanation":"The のいかんでは grammar point is used when you want to express that the outcome or decision hinges on the condition described in the noun preceding this phrase. It can be translated as 'depending on ___' or 'it depends on ___' in English.","formation":"Noun + のいかんでは","examples":[{"jp":"試験の結果のいかんでは、大学の入学許可を得られるかどうかが決まります。","romaji":"Shiken no kekka no ikan dewa, daigaku no nyuugaku kyoka o erareru ka douka ga kimarimasu.","en":"Whether you can get permission to enter university depends on the result of the exam.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大学","vocabId":"1413240","reading":"だいがく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入学","vocabId":"1465850","reading":"にゅうがく"},{"surface":"許可","vocabId":"1232880","reading":"きょか"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1588760","reading":"え","baseForm":"得る"},{"surface":"られる","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"決まります","vocabId":"1591420","reading":"きまります","baseForm":"決まる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"天気のいかんでは、ピクニックを延期するかもしれません。","romaji":"Tenki no ikan dewa, pikunikku o enki suru kamoshiremasen.","en":"Depending on the weather, we might delay the picnic.","words":[{"surface":"天気","vocabId":"1438690","reading":"てんき"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピクニック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"延期","vocabId":"1176430","reading":"えんき"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"交通事情のいかんでは、遅れることがあります。","romaji":"Koutsuujijou no ikan dewa, okureru koto ga arimasu.","en":"Depending on the traffic conditions, I might be late.","words":[{"surface":"交通事情","vocabId":"2725120","reading":"こうつうじじょう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れる","vocabId":"1589040","reading":"おくれる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"経済の状況のいかんでは、会社の将来は決まります。","romaji":"Keizai no joukyou no ikan dewa, kaisha no shourai wa kimarimasu.","en":"Depending on the state of the economy, the company's future is determined.","words":[{"surface":"経済","vocabId":"1251320","reading":"けいざい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"状況","vocabId":"1356700","reading":"じょうきょう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"将来","vocabId":"1347710","reading":"しょうらい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"決まります","vocabId":"1591420","reading":"きまります","baseForm":"決まる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]}],"kind":"construction"}